Package: tidyeavs
Title: Tidy Access to Election Administration and Voting Survey Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Zayne", "Sember", , "zaynesember@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A consistent interface to the U.S. Election Assistance
    Commission's Election Administration and Voting Survey (EAVS).
    Downloads published EAVS data, decodes its missing-value
    conventions, and harmonizes variable names across survey years so
    that local election jurisdictions can be compared over time. Raw
    data are read faithfully; the choices the package makes are
    documented and optional.
